s）构成的范畴（category），位于这个<MATH_0012>-范畴（category）中（见定义<REF_0002>）。这些全都是群胚（groupoids），见定义<REF_0003>后的注释。下面给出<MATH_0013>-范畴（category）版本的米田引理（Yoneda lemma）。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:f2e3ebdacfa8393b94012e9bf8a920649c5faeae6dd2c933fbf52e9f21fe0415", "unit_id": "tag:0GWH:prose-0002", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "基底、态射范畴及带阶数限定的范畴；待决。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "高阶范畴的对象；待决。", "source_term": "categories", "target_term": "范畴"}, {"context": "群胚纤维化性质；待决。", "source_term": "fibred", "target_term": "纤维化"}, {"context": "纤维化限定及态射范畴的性质；待决。", "source_term": "groupoids", "target_term": "群胚"}, {"context": "原文引号中的满子高阶范畴限定；待决。", "source_term": "full", "target_term": "满的"}, {"context": "带阶数限定的态射；待决。", "source_term": "morphisms", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "本节推广的引理；待决。", "source_term": "Yoneda lemma", "target_term": "米田引理"}]}
